[{"answer":"Some things are opposites of each other.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/89-opposites-2019-03-29-13-16-19/1.mp3"},{"answer":"The opposite of black is white.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/89-opposites-2019-03-29-13-16-19/2.mp3"},{"answer":"The opposite of happy is sad.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/89-opposites-2019-03-29-13-16-19/3.mp3"},{"answer":"If I am at the opposite side of the room from you,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/89-opposites-2019-03-29-13-16-19/4.mp3"},{"answer":"it means that I am at the other side of the room that you are on.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/89-opposites-2019-03-29-13-16-19/5.mp3"},{"answer":"The opposite of up is down","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/89-opposites-2019-03-29-13-16-19/6.mp3"},{"answer":"and the opposite of left is right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/89-opposites-2019-03-29-13-16-19/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you know what the opposite of young would be?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/89-opposites-2019-03-29-13-16-19/8.mp3"},{"answer":"Old is the opposite of young.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/89-opposites-2019-03-29-13-16-19/9.mp3"},{"answer":"What is the opposite of dirty?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/89-opposites-2019-03-29-13-16-19/10.mp3"},{"answer":"Clean is the opposite of dirty.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/89-opposites-2019-03-29-13-16-19/11.mp3"},{"answer":"Big is the opposite of small.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/89-opposites-2019-03-29-13-16-19/12.mp3"},{"answer":"Man is the opposite of woman.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/89-opposites-2019-03-29-13-16-19/13.mp3"},{"answer":"Boy is the opposite of girl.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/89-opposites-2019-03-29-13-16-19/14.mp3"},{"answer":"Sometimes people think the opposite things than other people.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/89-opposites-2019-03-29-13-16-19/15.mp3"},{"answer":"Someone might be wrong and someone might be right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/89-opposites-2019-03-29-13-16-19/16.mp3"},{"answer":"The opposite of mother is father.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/89-opposites-2019-03-29-13-16-19/17.mp3"},{"answer":"See if you can think of some opposites.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/89-opposites-2019-03-29-13-16-19/18.mp3"},{"answer":"It is cold in the winter,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/89-opposites-2019-03-29-13-16-19/19.mp3"},{"answer":"and it is hot in the summer.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/89-opposites-2019-03-29-13-16-19/20.mp3"},{"answer":"My father is very tall,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/89-opposites-2019-03-29-13-16-19/21.mp3"},{"answer":"and my brother is very short.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/89-opposites-2019-03-29-13-16-19/22.mp3"},{"answer":"A rock is hard, but a pillow is soft.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/89-opposites-2019-03-29-13-16-19/23.mp3"},{"answer":"An ocean is deep, but a puddle is shallow.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/89-opposites-2019-03-29-13-16-19/24.mp3"},{"answer":"I might tell the truth, but I might tell a lie.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/89-opposites-2019-03-29-13-16-19/25.mp3"},{"answer":"All of these things are opposites.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/89-opposites-2019-03-29-13-16-19/26.mp3"},{"answer":"The morning is bright, but the night is dark.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/89-opposites-2019-03-29-13-16-19/27.mp3"},{"answer":"A feather is light, but an elephant is heavy.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/89-opposites-2019-03-29-13-16-19/28.mp3"},{"answer":"Sugar is sweet, but a lemon is sour.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/89-opposites-2019-03-29-13-16-19/29.mp3"},{"answer":"A jet plane is fast, but a turtle is slow.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/89-opposites-2019-03-29-13-16-19/30.mp3"},{"answer":"I can go out in the day, or I can go out at night.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/89-opposites-2019-03-29-13-16-19/31.mp3"},{"answer":"I might love to swim, or I might hate to swim.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/89-opposites-2019-03-29-13-16-19/32.mp3"},{"answer":"It is interesting to see how many opposites you can think up.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/89-opposites-2019-03-29-13-16-19/33.mp3"},{"answer":"I could say hello, but I think it's time to say goodbye.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/89-opposites-2019-03-29-13-16-19/34.mp3"}]
